body:
This is a more general issue of our mapping API. I haven't figured out the cause yet, but here is a minimal recreation that reproduces the issue all the time:

```
PUT t
{
  "mappings": {
    "one": {
      "properties": {
        "foo": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

PUT t/two/_mapping
{
  "two": {

  }
}

PUT t/two/_mapping
{
  "two": {
    "properties": {
      "foo": {
        "type": "long"
      }
    }
  }
}

PUT t/two/_mapping
{
  "two": {
    "properties": {
      "foo": {
        "type": "long"
      }
    }
  }
}

GET t/_mapping
```
